The second one I got is the peacemaker, which I feel like I identify more with.
我测出的第二个是和平主义者，我觉得这个我更有共鸣。

1146
00:45:57.190 --> 00:45:57.650
Okay.
好吧。

1147
00:45:58.030 --> 00:45:58.870
So we have...
所以我们有……

1148
00:45:58.870 --> 00:45:59.790
Do we have a good balance?
我们搭配得平衡吗？

1149
00:45:59.990 --> 00:46:06.610
We have, well, two reformers, one reformer slash peacemaker, one helper slash challenger.
我们有，嗯，两个完美主义者，一个完美主义兼和平主义者，一个助人者兼挑战者。

1150
00:46:06.750 --> 00:46:08.150
Is that a good way to make a podcast?
这是做播客的好阵容吗？

1151
00:46:08.150 --> 00:46:08.950
It's working.
在运作了。

1152
00:46:08.950 --> 00:46:13.090
Well, I think it's a pretty good way to make a podcast, because y'all, this is our 300th
嗯，我觉得这真是制作播客的好方法，因为各位，这是我们的第300个

1153
00:46:13.090 --> 00:46:13.650
episode.
单集。

1154
00:46:14.070 --> 00:46:14.790
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

1155
00:46:15.550 --> 00:46:17.050
How's about that?
感觉怎么样？

1156
00:46:17.250 --> 00:46:18.690
300 episodes!
300个单集！

1157
00:46:19.170 --> 00:46:19.370
Yeah!
耶！

1158
00:46:19.590 --> 00:46:22.290
Over 501 million downloads.
下载量超过5.01亿次。

1159
00:46:22.910 --> 00:46:23.330
Hey!
嘿！

1160
00:46:23.730 --> 00:46:24.190
I know.
我知道。

1161
00:46:24.450 --> 00:46:25.530
Really, I should write music.
真的，我应该去写音乐。

1162
00:46:25.630 --> 00:46:26.750
Why don't we write jingles?
我们为什么不写广告歌呢？

1163
00:46:26.890 --> 00:46:27.290
We should.
我们应该的。

1164
00:46:27.490 --> 00:46:30.190
Well, listen, thank you to everyone who wrote in.
好了，听着，谢谢所有写信来的人。

1165
00:46:30.190 --> 00:46:33.850
We had a great time with this episode, and we'll see you next week.
我们这期节目过得很愉快，我们下周见。

1166
00:46:33.990 --> 00:46:34.550
See you then.
到时见。

1167
00:46:34.550 --> 00:46:38.720
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

1168
00:46:38.980 --> 00:46:44.100
Office Ladies is a presentation of Odyssey and is produced by Jenna Fisher and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》是奥德赛呈献的节目，由珍娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金西制作。

1169
00:46:44.320 --> 00:46:48.520
Our senior producer is Matt Beagle, and our audio engineer is Sam Kiefer.
我们的资深制作人是马特·比格尔，音频工程师是萨姆·基弗。

1170
00:46:48.800 --> 00:46:51.360
Odyssey's executive producer is Leah Reese Dennis.
奥德赛的执行制作人是莉亚·里斯·丹尼斯。

1171
00:46:51.780 --> 00:46:54.600
Office Ladies was mixed and mastered by Bill Schultz.
《办公室女士》由比尔·舒尔茨进行混音和母带制作。

1172
00:46:54.720 --> 00:46:57.580
Our theme song is Ruppertree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿创作的《Ruppertree》。
